<title>GERMANY: German March import prices unchanged m/m.</title>
<headline>German March import prices unchanged m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    Mar 97	Feb 97	Mar 96</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  unch	  +0.5	 +0.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +2.7	  +3.0	 +0.4</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 100.5	 100.5	 97.9</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.2	  +0.3	 +0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +0.8	  +0.8	 +0.6</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 104.4	 104.2	103.6</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
